I am in my room.
I open my cupboard.
There is a lot of sun outside today.
The weather is very hot.
I want light clothes today.
I take out a shirt from the cupboard.
This is my new shirt.
The color of this shirt is white.
This is a cotton shirt.
Cotton clothes are good in the summer.
I put on that white shirt.
That shirt is very light.
I feel comfortable now.
I look in the mirror.
This new shirt looks nice.
It will get very hot outside all day today.
But it will rain in the evening.
Now I am ready for the office.
I take my bag.
I step out of the house.
